        "content": "## Conversation Logging — Ostad AI Receptionist\nStores every AI Receptionist phone conversation into the \"Ostad AI Receptionist Database\" Google Sheet (CALL LOGS tab).\n\n**Flow:** Webhook (POST) → Validate fields → Append row → Respond JSON.\n\n**Expected JSON body:** transcript, summary, intent, sentiment, duration, timestamp.",
